sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Data Scientist / Client
    participant UI as ml-pipeline-ui<br/>80/TCP → 3000/TCP
    participant API as ml-pipeline API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP | 8887/TCP gRPC
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ArgoWF as Argo Workflow Controller
    participant Driver as Driver Pod
    participant Launcher as Launcher-v2
    participant MySQL as MySQL<br/>3306/TCP
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage
    participant MLMD as ML Metadata<br/>Envoy :9090 → MLMD :8080
    participant PA as Persistence Agent
    participant Cache as Cache Server<br/>443/TCP TLS
    participant SWC as Scheduled Workflow Controller

    Note over Client, SWC: Pipeline Submission & Execution Flow

    Client->>API: POST /apis/v2beta1/pipelines/upload<br/>Pipeline definition
    API->>K8s: TokenReview (authenticate user)
    K8s-->>API: User identity validated
    API->>K8s: SubjectAccessReview (authorize action)
    K8s-->>API: Access granted
    API->>MySQL: Persist pipeline metadata
    API->>S3: Store pipeline artifacts
    API-->>Client: Pipeline created

    Client->>API: POST RunService/CreateRun<br/>gRPC :8887
    API->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    K8s-->>API: Authorized
    API->>K8s: Create Argo Workflow CR
    API->>MySQL: Record run metadata

    Note over ArgoWF, Launcher: Workflow Execution

    K8s->>ArgoWF: Workflow CR created event
    ArgoWF->>Driver: Launch driver pod (step manager)
    Driver->>Launcher: Launch step container
    Launcher->>S3: Download input artifacts
    S3-->>Launcher: Artifacts
    Launcher->>Launcher: Execute pipeline step
    Launcher->>S3: Upload output artifacts

    Note over Cache, K8s: Admission Webhook (Caching)

    K8s->>Cache: Mutating webhook<br/>POST /webhooks/mutate-pipelineversion :8443 TLS
    Cache-->>K8s: Admit/Mutate response
    K8s->>Cache: Validating webhook<br/>POST /webhooks/validate-pipelineversion :8443 TLS
    Cache-->>K8s: Validation result

    Note over PA, MySQL: State Synchronization

    PA->>K8s: Watch Argo Workflow status
    K8s-->>PA: Workflow status update
    PA->>API: Report run completion/status
    API->>MySQL: Update run state

    Note over MLMD, Driver: Metadata & Lineage Tracking

    Driver->>MLMD: Record execution metadata<br/>gRPC via Envoy :9090
    MLMD->>MySQL: Persist ML metadata

    Note over SWC, K8s: Recurring Runs

    SWC->>K8s: Watch ScheduledWorkflow CRs
    K8s-->>SWC: Schedule trigger
    SWC->>K8s: Create new Argo Workflow CR

    Note over Client, UI: UI Access

    Client->>UI: Browse pipelines & runs<br/>HTTP :80
    UI->>API: Query pipeline data<br/>REST :8888
    API-->>UI: Pipeline/run results
    UI-->>Client: Rendered UI
